msgstr "[三项业务停摆的原因 · 现场台账]\n找到交接业务编号对应的观察，对比两条记录。混入相似的无关行会把不同事件混为一谈。\n\nREFERENCE REC23\n\nFIELD DESK\nbefore:photos+notify+staff:working\n\nHANDOFF TRANSCRIPT\nblanket-rule:three-workflows:blocked\n\nOTHER ENTRY\nreference: OTHER-REC23\nobservation: unrelated service job\n"

msgid "M23_E1_FINDING"
